Description: ui: copy native line samples into the stereo surface
 .
 Validate the source bounds and SHM allocation size before copying. Keep
 the two row parities separate and hide stale presentation on invalid
 metadata.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
